  "description": "Explore everywhere\nOur mid-range T-140 RS is our fastest and most versatile full-suspension trail bike that's perfect for finding every sort of fun on any terrain. Add in a specially curated parts selection for the best blend of performance and value so your money goes as far as you will, our extended lifetime frame and pivot bearing warranties, and weather-sealed features, and you've got everyday excellence, every where.\n\nHighlights\n– 140mm front and 135mm of rear suspension travel.\n– 6061 aluminium SCR framet with ISCG 2 guide mounts + geometry adjustment + Boost dropouts.\n– Fox Float 34 Performance Elite 29in fork + custom-tuned Fox DPS – Performance Elite Evol LV shock.\n– SRAM GX Eagle 12 speed mechanical transmission (32T chainring x 11-52T cassette).\n– 29in trail-smoothing wheels front and rear.\n– Can be converted to MX wheels (29er front, 27.5in rear) for a more gravity-focused ride.",
